OL,3,AUS and China must act as responsible
OL,4,Apowers together, Xi says as Trump
OL,5,Atoasts friendship at state dinner
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth Trump and Xi praised one another,
OL,8,Fpledging to continue talks to ensure
OL,9,Fstability between their two nations.
OL,10,FBut experts say that not much concrete
OL,11,Fhas been yielded in talks so far.
OL,13,FThe dinner came on the second day of
OL,14,FXi's three-day trip to Washington.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
